>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `add_safe_simp_wrapper`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.add_safe_simp_wrapper :
  simpLib.simpset -> clasetLib.claset -> clasetLib.claset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Adds safe assumption-aware full simplification as a safe wrapper.

`add_safe_simp_wrapper ss cs` returns `cs` with a wrapper named
`"safe_asm_full_simp_tac"`. The wrapper first runs the wrapped safe
classical step. Only when that step has no result does it offer a changed
safe-simplification transition using `ss`.

Safe simplification avoids unsafe solvers and unsafe simpset operations.
The operation does not change `cs`, `ss`, or the global claset. Adding a
wrapper with the same name replaces the existing wrapper in the returned
claset.

### Failure

Construction does not fail. The wrapper has no result when neither the
wrapped step nor safe simplification changes the goal.

### Example

``` hol4
val safe_cs =
  clasimpLib.add_safe_simp_wrapper
    (clasimpLib.clasimp_ss ()) (clasetLib.the_claset ());
```

